              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Type-safe pick?** `pick<T, K extends keyof T>(o: T, ks: K[]): Pick<T, K>`",
                "**Ties key to object?** `K extends keyof T`",
